    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge <strong>endless</strong>\u00a0<strong>hordes </strong>of enemies and try to survive until the <strong>Rift Convergence</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563780/extras/e85d4511fb9ea27621926079f5671db5.poster.avif?t=1751314588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563780/extras/e85d4511fb9ea27621926079f5671db5.webm?t=1751314588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563780/extras/e85d4511fb9ea27621926079f5671db5.mp4?t=1751314588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to upgrade your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563780/extras/b287405288caffd28bef51de899742eb.poster.avif?t=1751314588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563780/extras/b287405288caffd28bef51de899742eb.webm?t=1751314588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563780/extras/b287405288caffd28bef51de899742eb.mp4?t=1751314588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create powerful builds!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563780/extras/08a32f053455b10a2d1484d5e7e7f8e1.poster.avif?t=1751314588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563780/extras/08a32f053455b10a2d1484d5e7e7f8e1.webm?t=1751314588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563780/extras/08a32f053455b10a2d1484d5e7e7f8e1.mp4?t=1751314588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run will be different, play to the strengths of your weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563780/extras/abbe7fd0c29a004be620ecc69166dfc9.poster.avif?t=1751314588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563780/extras/abbe7fd0c29a004be620ecc69166dfc9.webm?t=1751314588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563780/extras/abbe7fd0c29a004be620ecc69166dfc9.mp4?t=1751314588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
